  mapId: MAP-056
  displayName: Silent Valley
  environment: Rural / Mountain
  warfareFocus: Recon & stealth
  executiveSummary: Rural-mountain reconnaissance battlefield for stealth operations, autonomous search, low-visibility movement, and precision reconnaissance across layered elevation.
  designGoals:
  - name: Stealth-Focused Mountain Recon
    description: 
  - name: 
    description: Scouting, tracking, infiltration, and precision reconnaissance exploit forest cover and elevation.
