  terrain: Forested slopes, narrow mountain passes, abandoned farmsteads, rocky outcrops, mist-filled valleys, cliffside trails, and hidden observation posts.
  vegetation: Dense trees, shrubs, ferns, and underbrush.
  buildingsAndProps: 'Military: radar dishes, thermal relays, bunkers. Rural: cabins, barns, fences, wooden structures. Logistics: trucks, crates, fuel drums, drones.'
  effects: Fog, humidity haze, rain, canopy shadows, and dust.
  audio: Wind, insects, distant machinery, river flow, and radio chatter.
  lodBudget:
  - category: Primary Terrain
    count: 3
    trianglesPerItem: 200000
    totalTriangles: 600000
  - category: Industrial/Rural
    count: 4
    trianglesPerItem: 80000
    totalTriangles: 320000
